* Severe Thunderstorm Warning for...

  Southwestern Natrona County in central Wyoming...



* Until 745 PM MDT.



* At 656 PM MDT, a severe thunderstorm was located 8 miles northwest

  of Devil's Gate, which is 24 miles east of Jeffrey City, moving

  northeast at 30 mph.



  HAZARD...60 mph wind gusts and quarter size hail.



  SOURCE...Radar indicated.



