      4100 10205 4044 10205 4044 10278 4035 10278

      4035 10279 4013 10279 4005 10317

TIME...MOT...LOC 0224Z 307DEG 25KT 4099 10253 4061 10280 4047 10318



THUNDERSTORM DAMAGE THREAT...CONSIDERABLE

HAIL THREAT...RADAR INDICATED

MAX HAIL SIZE...<1.00 IN

WIND THREAT...RADAR INDICATED

MAX WIND GUST...70 MPH



