* Severe Thunderstorm Warning for...

  Southeastern Bell County in central Texas...



* Until 345 PM CDT.



* At 320 PM CDT, severe thunderstorms were located along a line

  extending from near Troy to near Little River-Academy to near

  Salado, moving southeast at 20 mph.



