...FLOOD WARNING NOW IN EFFECT UNTIL EARLY TOMORROW AFTERNOON...



* WHAT...Minor flooding is occurring and minor flooding is forecast.



* WHERE...Rocky River near Norwood.



* WHEN...Until early tomorrow afternoon.



* IMPACTS...At 16.0 feet, Action Stage. The river begins to overflow 

  its banks in some areas upstream of the gage site.

  At 20.0 feet, Minor flood stage. There is significant overflow 

  into adjacent pasture and lowlands.



